*
*  Optimize parameters for H, C, N, and O
*  using simple compounds of H, C, N, and O plus halogens
*
*  Di-atomic parameters involving a halogen and one of H, C, N, and O are optimized,
*  but no parameters that do not involve H, C, N, or O are optimized.
*
 cycles=50 PM7  ref="../../reference data/data normal"; &
 "../../reference data/data erratic";"../../reference data/data levels"    set="set chno.txt" params= &
 "CHno.rp"
 alpb_h H 0.9 5
xfac_c H 0.1 5 
xfac_n H 0.1 5       
xfac_o H 0.1 5       
FN21 N 0.5 5
FN21 C 0.5 5
HSP C 0.5 5
xfac_O O 0.1 5 
xfac_F F 0.1 5             
(H C N O)(All)
PAR5  -100 100
PAR6  -100 100
PAR7  -100 100
PAR8  -100 100
PAR9  -100 100
end
bicycbutr
but2yner
